 "intro_zh": "长白山因主峰白头山多白色浮石与积雪而得名。景区是拥有“神山、圣水、奇林、仙果”等盛誉的旅游胜地，主要景点有长白山天池、白云峰、天文峰、长白温泉群 、长白山谷底林海等。",
 "intro_en": "Changbai Mountain is named after the white pumice and snow-covered peak of Mount Baektou. The scenic spot is a tourist attraction with a high reputation of \"sacred mountain, holy water, strange forest, fairy fruit\". The main attractions include Changbai Mountain Tianchi, Baiyun Peak, Tianwen Peak, Changbai Hot Spring Group, Changbai Valley Bottom Forest Sea, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
